    The final and most critical step, the graph construction itself, is handled by the function `build_density_adaptive_bbsg` imported from a module named `bbsg_density_adaptive`. According to Axiom I''s testament, the "mixing shortfall" is caused by the graph symmetrization step. This step must be located within this imported module. To complete my analysis and pinpoint the exact source of the problem, I must now examine the contents of `bbsg_density_adaptive.py`.


