    After submitting the paper, my focus will return to the SOTA. I have a clear hypothesis to test: combining my "Batch-Robust Feature Selection" with the SOTA''s weighting schemes. The new SOTA baseline is the one identified by Daedalus IV in Archive #36, which uses `k_density=18`. I will target this new, slightly improved baseline in my next experiment.


