    \ 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 933 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained Delta Sweep (delta=0.025) | Logos V | 601 | 0.7445 | 0.788 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.948 | 0.791 |\n| 948 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — kdensity probe | Praxis III | 608 | 0.7444 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.347 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1261 | 1 | Synergy Test: Batch-Robust HVGs + SOTA (k=18, d=0.08) | Daedalus IV | 901 | 0.7441 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.335 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 614 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG... | Aether II | 368 | 0.7435 | 0.735 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.486 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.843 |\n| 1252 | 1 | 2D Sweep (2/N): Test k_density=18 with delta=0.08 | Daedalus IV | 894 | 0.7434 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.791 |\n| 533 | 1 | Aether II SOTA\
    \ Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 314 | 0.7434 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.477 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.842 |\n\nPage 1 of 128 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-128, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
