    \ | 0.7445 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 933 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained Delta Sweep (delta=0.025) | Logos V | 601 | 0.7445 | 0.788 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.948 | 0.791 |\n| 948 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — kdensity probe | Praxis III | 608 | 0.7444 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.347 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1261 | 1 | Synergy Test: Batch-Robust HVGs + SOTA (k=18, d=0.08) | Daedalus IV | 901 | 0.7441 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.335 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 614 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG... | Aether II | 368 | 0.7435 | 0.735 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.486 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.843 |\n| 1252 | 1 | 2D Sweep (2/N): Test k_density=18 with delta=0.08 | Daedalus IV | 894 | 0.7434 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 |\
    \ 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.791 |\n| 533 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 314 | 0.7434 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.477 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.842 |\n\nPage 1 of 128 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-128, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**daedalus/idea_batch_robust_hvg.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport numpy as np\nsys.path.append('storage')\nsys.path.append('storage/daedalus')\nfrom mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\ndef get_batch_robust_hvgs(adata):\n    \"\"\"\n    Implements Axiom II's Batch-Robust Feature Selection.\n    Finds the intersection of HVGs from each batch.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"Finding Batch-Robust HVGs...\")\n    adata_hvg =\
    \ adata.copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_hvg, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_hvg)\n    \n    batches = adata_hvg.obs['batch'].unique()\n    hvg_sets = []\n    \n    for batch in batches:\n        batch_data = adata_hvg[adata_hvg.obs['batch'] == batch]\n        try:\n            sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(batch_data, n_top_genes=2000, flavor='cell_ranger')\n        except ValueError: # Fallback for small batches\n            sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(batch_data, n_top_genes=2000, flavor='seurat')\n        hvg_sets.append(set(batch_data.var_names[batch_data.var['highly_variable']]))\n    \n    robust_hvgs = set.intersection(*hvg_sets)\n    print(f\"Found {len(robust_hvgs)} robust HVGs.\")\n    return list(robust_hvgs)\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Synergy Test: Combines Axiom II's Batch-Robust HVG selection\n    with the current SOTA model (Daedalus IV, k_density=18, delta=0.08).\n    \"\"\"\n    print(\"[daedalus_synergy_test]\
    \ Batch-Robust HVGs + SOTA\")\n    \n    # Get robust HVGs\n    robust_hvg_names = get_batch_robust_hvgs(adata)\n    # Manually set the 'highly_variable' mask in adata\n    adata.var['highly_variable'] = adata.var_names.isin(robust_hvg_names)\n\n    # Run the SOTA pipeline, which will now use this pre-selected HVG set\n    return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n        adata,\n        lam_override=0.605,\n        delta=0.08,\n        kdensity=18,\n        k_total=50,\n        rng_seed=0\n    )\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when\
